{'symbol': 'VTRS', 'date': '2021-11-18 06:59:00', 'title': 'VIATRIS TO PARTICIPATE IN EVERCORE ISI 4TH ANNUAL HEALTHCONX CONFERENCE', 'text': 'PITTSBURGH, NOV. 18, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0VIATRIS\xa0INC.\xa0(NASDAQ: VTRS) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE COMPANY WILL TAKE PART IN A VIRTUAL FIRESIDE CHAT AT THE EVERCORE ISI 4TH ANNUAL HEALTHCONX CONFERENCE ON WEDNESDAY, DECEMBER 1, 2021. CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER MICHAEL GOETTLER , PRESIDENT RAJIV MALIK \xa0AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER SANJEEV NARULA \xa0WILL ANSWER QUESTIONS ABOUT THE COMPANY AT 7:30 A.M.'}